pub fn check(ctx: &Ctx, env: &Env, term: &TermRef, ty: &ValueRef) -> Result<(), TypeError>
pub fn conv(depth: usize, a: &ValueRef, b: &ValueRef) -> bool
```

`conv` is anticlimactic by design — we chose the naive-correct version:

```rust
pub fn conv(depth: usize, a: &ValueRef, b: &ValueRef) -> bool {
    quote(depth, a) == quote(depth, b)   // normalize both, compare. Act 3. That's it.
}
